#: ../../source/database/connecting.rst:93
msgid "Reconnecting / Keeping the Connection Alive"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/database/connecting.rst:95
msgid ""
"If the database server's idle timeout is exceeded while you're doing some"
" heavy PHP lifting (processing an image, for instance), you should "
"consider calling the ``reconnect()`` method before sending further "
"queries, which can gracefully keep the connection alive or re-establish "
"it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/database/connecting.rst:100
msgid ""
"The ``reconnect()`` method pings the server to check if the connection is"
" still alive. If the connection has been lost, it will close and re-"
"establish the connection."
msgstr ""

